It really does work.
It does work.

21
00:00:55.090 --> 00:00:58.930
Also, I want to hold up your beautiful book.

22
00:00:58.930 --> 00:01:01.160
The World Needs More Purple People.

23
00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:02.090
My friend, Ben and I,

24
00:01:02.090 --> 00:01:04.340
we were sitting around the dinner table

25
00:01:04.340 --> 00:01:07.810
and just seeing a very polarizing political culture

26
00:01:07.810 --> 00:01:09.810
seep into our little kids' daily lives

27
00:01:09.810 --> 00:01:11.660
and we wanted to create some language to help

28
00:01:11.660 --> 00:01:13.360
so that, you know, the metaphor of it,

29
00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:16.790
it's not secret is that red plus blue equals purple

30
00:01:16.790 --> 00:01:19.030
and we just, we didn't want to any of our kids

31
00:01:19.030 --> 00:01:20.503
looking around seeing enemies

32
00:01:20.503 --> 00:01:23.960
and 'cause this is the United States, you know,

33
00:01:23.960 --> 00:01:26.530
so we figured out the five pillars we loved

34
00:01:26.530 --> 00:01:28.210
that no one could argue with like,

35
00:01:28.210 --> 00:01:31.280
purple, being a purple person means laughing a lot,

36
00:01:31.280 --> 00:01:33.710
being silly, using your voice, working hard

37
00:01:33.710 --> 00:01:35.980
and then also being uniquely you.

38
00:01:35.980 --> 00:01:38.220
So it's about like celebrating the differences

39
00:01:38.220 --> 00:01:39.810
and uniqueness's within each other,

40
00:01:39.810 --> 00:01:42.890
but also not seeing one another as enemies,

41
00:01:42.890 --> 00:01:45.010
looking towards our fellow human beings

42
00:01:45.010 --> 00:01:46.270
and my secret plan

43
00:01:46.270 --> 00:01:48.750
is that the adults will read it with the kids

44
00:01:48.750 --> 00:01:50.590
'cause we wrote a kid's book

45
00:01:50.590 --> 00:01:52.170
so that the kids could have some help,

46
00:01:52.170 --> 00:01:53.400
but I think it's the adults

47
00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:54.920
that need the majority of the help

48
00:01:54.920 --> 00:01:57.030
'cause there's so much fighting and divisiveness

49
00:01:57.030 --> 00:01:59.910
and I just don't want America to exist like that.

50
00:01:59.910 --> 00:02:04.430
With all that is out there for kids to see,

51
00:02:04.430 --> 00:02:06.980
we have to help make sense of it for them

52
00:02:06.980 --> 00:02:10.540
and guide them to being loving, un-judgmental,

53
00:02:10.540 --> 00:02:15.540
open-minded, open-hearted, grateful and kind beings.

54
00:02:16.150 --> 00:02:18.870
I don't think guiding them means staying secretive.

55
00:02:18.870 --> 00:02:21.130
You know, like we tell our kids all the time,

56
00:02:21.130 --> 00:02:23.270
like there's a ton of crazy crap on the internet.

57
00:02:23.270 --> 00:02:24.850
That's why you're not allowed to use it

58
00:02:24.850 --> 00:02:27.280
and it's also why you're not allowed to drive my car

59
00:02:27.280 --> 00:02:28.830
or drink alcohol or vote

60
00:02:28.830 --> 00:02:31.630
'cause you can't read about the propositions yet.

61
00:02:31.630 --> 00:02:32.706
So like there's just certain things

62
00:02:32.706 --> 00:02:34.870
that are meant for an older brain

63
00:02:34.870 --> 00:02:36.890
and like, I just don't think, you know,

64
00:02:36.890 --> 00:02:39.140
pretending like, at least this is how we do it

65
00:02:39.140 --> 00:02:41.210
in our family, which it's different for everyone,

66
00:02:41.210 --> 00:02:43.430
but we are very honest with our girls 'cause,

67
00:02:43.430 --> 00:02:48.080
and they need, I think they need to know what forms hate

68
00:02:48.080 --> 00:02:51.150
and in our family, we talk about the fact that it's fear.

69
00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:53.620
People get fearful and then they start hating.

70
00:02:53.620 --> 00:02:56.450
So we got to do our best to overcome those fears

71
00:02:56.450 --> 00:03:00.300
and remember that we are all human and need to

72
00:03:00.300 --> 00:03:02.220
treat each other that way.

73
00:03:02.220 --> 00:03:05.280
Thank you for all of the stuff that you put out

74
00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:08.490
into the world and curate for us.

75
00:03:08.490 --> 00:03:12.140
Your children's book, The World Needs More Purple People

76
00:03:12.140 --> 00:03:15.120
and your skincare line, Happy Dance

77
00:03:15.120 --> 00:03:17.654
are both available right now.

78
